%% showcase: xychart with front matter
%% prose: Mermaid's docs turn on bar value labels through YAML front matter. mmd reads the front matter's title and ignores its config, as it ignores %%{init}%% directives, so the chart renders without the data labels it asks for.
%% approx: Front matter `config` (here showDataLabel) is ignored: no value labels on the bars.
---
title: Front matter title
config:
  xyChart:
    showDataLabel: true
---
xychart-beta
    title "Sales Revenue"
    x-axis [jan, feb, mar, apr, may]
    y-axis "Revenue (in $)" 4000 --> 11000
    bar [5000, 6000, 7500, 8200, 9500]
